  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile settings (config_018, 0.6186 accuracy; config_024, 0.6287 accuracy) outperform singleprofile configurations. These top performers use pca_n2000 RNA encoder, imagenet_vit_l image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and concat fusion. This experiment tests whether switching to weighted fusion (instead of concat) in this high-performing configuration improves accuracy. It directly addresses the importance of fusion strategy in multimodal multiprofile settings, a critical design choice with sparse evidence yet."
}

